          "copies/dc920rk8870.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "pencil, five figures run together with no separators; read from the lower (180-degree) panel. A 9 with a closed top loop over a long descender, two plain slanted 1s, a 2 finished with a horizontal base, and a 5 with its top bar and lower bowl. Five figures admit only the reading 9.11.25."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
